# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ripplepy .gitignore
# GitHub 只同步代码；服务器/本地生成的运行数据一律忽略。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
build/

# Fortran build artifacts
*.mod
*.o
*.obj

# CMake / scikit-build
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
*.cmake
_skbuild/
build_local/

# Locally built Python package extension (generated, not committed)
python/ripplepy/_effective_ripple*.so
python/ripplepy/effective_ripple.py

# Runtime logs / data / plots / CSVs (run outputs never sync to GitHub)
*.log
*.h5
*.png
*.csv

# VMEC / parvmec stray outputs at the repo root only
# (root-anchored: /for* would also match fortran/, so "for" is omitted;
#  mgrid* would also match python/ripplepy/mgrid.py)
/threed*
/parvmec*
/timing*
/mgrid*
/extcur*
/log*
/log_xgrid*

# Test data and run-output directories (server-side data)
tests/test_file/
tests/h1_islands/
tests/h1_islands_smoke/
tests/h1_optimisation/
tests/h1_island_optimisation/
tests/fieldline_cache/
tests/benchmark_results/
poster/*


# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Misc
.reasonix/
reasonix.toml
